  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此材質包將來自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iron's spellbook 模組</a>的法術書改為 3D 模型，看起來更帥氣了 <del>(真的嗎？居然有本書長得像豬排)</del></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/664/613/520.gif\" alt=\"法術書\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>法術：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/665/522/522.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>自訂物品（需要 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT</a> 模組）：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">哈利波特風格魔杖：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模型：</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/712/715/base_wand.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"367\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/712/716/2023-08-16_09.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"372\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">法術效果：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/712/710/2023-08-16_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">改名後：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/818/151/qq20240303185100.png\" width=\"899\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">透過鐵砧將任意法杖改名即可套用此效果。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">鳴謝：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#36f\">感謝 <a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/gusbaruc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Baruc</a> 協助我修復物品圖示。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">Discord 伺服器：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#36f\"><strong><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/TRzEdrndM2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's spells and spell book：https://discord.gg/TRzEdrndM2</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">使用許可：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#36f\">您可以將此材質包用於任何整合包中。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#36f\"><strong>已取得 Iron 的授權：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/665/167/permission.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1353\" height=\"532\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span></span></p>",
